      "review.grammarly.track.your.writing.stats.and": "Track your writing stats and improvement over time. Get personalized insights on vocabulary, productivity, and accuracy.",
      "review.grammarly.try.free": "Try Free →",
      "review.grammarly.used.by.students.professionals.and": "Used by students, professionals, and businesses worldwide, Grammarly has evolved from a grammar checker into a comprehensive writing assistant. The platform's generative AI features can now help you compose, rewrite, and ideate, making it a complete solution for anyone who writes regularly. Whether you're crafting emails, writing reports, or creating content, Grammarly helps you communicate more effectively.",
