      "review.grammarly.view.pricing": "View Pricing",
      "review.grammarly.what.makes.grammarly.exceptional.is": "What makes Grammarly exceptional is its seamless integration across virtually every writing platform you use. From web browsers and Microsoft Office to Gmail, Slack, and social media, Grammarly works wherever you write. Its AI-powered tone detection helps ensure your message lands the right way, while advanced features like plagiarism detection and brand consistency tools make it invaluable for professionals.",
      "review.grammarly.wordtune.focuses.more.on.rewriting": "Wordtune focuses more on rewriting and rephrasing suggestions, while Grammarly emphasizes correctness and clarity. Grammarly has better grammar checking and broader platform support. Wordtune offers more creative rewriting options but lacks plagiarism detection. Both tools complement each other well.",
      "review.grammarly.works.everywhere.you.write.online": "Works everywhere you write online - Gmail, social media, Google Docs, and more. Seamless integration across all platforms.",
