      "review.grammarly.explore.grammarlys.interface": "Explore Grammarly's interface:",
      "review.grammarly.faq1.answer": "Absolutely. The free version catches grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors effectively and works across all your writing platforms. While it lacks advanced features like tone detection and plagiarism checking, it's still one of the best free writing tools available and provides real value for casual users.",
      "review.grammarly.faq1.question": "Is Grammarly's free version worth using?",
      "review.grammarly.faq2.answer": "Grammarly's plagiarism checker (Premium feature) compares your text against over 16 billion web pages and academic databases. It highlights passages that match existing content and provides links to the original sources, helping you properly cite sources and ensure your work is original.",
      "review.grammarly.faq2.question": "How does Grammarly's plagiarism checker work?",
      "review.grammarly.faq3.answer": "Yes, Grammarly offers keyboard apps for both iOS and Android that provide real-time writing suggestions across all your mobile apps. You can use Grammarly in email, social media, messaging apps, and anywhere else you type on your phone or tablet.",
      "review.grammarly.faq3.question": "Does Grammarly work on mobile devices?",
      "review.grammarly.faq4.answer": "Yes, Grammarly provides explanations for each suggestion, helping you understand grammar rules and writing principles. Over time, you'll recognize patterns in your mistakes and learn to avoid them. Premium users also get detailed performance insights showing writing trends and areas for improvement.",
      "review.grammarly.faq4.question": "Can Grammarly help improve my writing skills?",
      "review.grammarly.faq5.answer": "Grammarly uses enterprise-grade security including 256-bit AES encryption and SOC 2 Type 2 certification. Your text is encrypted in transit and at rest. Grammarly doesn't sell your data or use it for advertising. Business and Enterprise plans offer additional security features like SAML SSO.",
      "review.grammarly.faq5.question": "Is my writing data safe with Grammarly?",
      "review.grammarly.faq6.answer": "Premium is for individuals and includes all writing enhancement features. Business is for teams of 3+ and adds brand consistency tools (style guides, brand tones), team management features, centralized billing, and analytics dashboards. Business is ideal for companies wanting to maintain consistent writing quality across their organization.",
