      "review.grammarly.premium": "Premium",
      "review.grammarly.premium.features.can.be.expensive": "Premium features can be expensive",
      "review.grammarly.price": "Price",
      "review.grammarly.professional.emails.ensure.error-free.professional": "Professional Emails: Ensure error-free, professional communication with colleagues and clients",
      "review.grammarly.pros.cons": "Pros & Cons",
      "review.grammarly.real-time.suggestions.as.you.type": "Real-time suggestions as you type",
      "review.grammarly.scans.your.text.against.billions": "Scans your text against billions of web pages. Ensures originality and proper citations for academic and professional work.",
      "review.grammarly.social.media.craft.engaging.posts": "Social Media: Craft engaging posts with appropriate tone across platforms",
      "review.grammarly.some.false.positives.in.corrections": "Some false positives in corrections",
      "review.grammarly.sometimes.overly.aggressive.suggestions": "Sometimes overly aggressive suggestions",
      "review.grammarly.team.communication.maintain.professional.standards": "Team Communication: Maintain professional standards in Slack, Teams, and email",
      "review.grammarly.track.your.writing.stats.and": "Track your writing stats and improvement over time. Get personalized insights on vocabulary, productivity, and accuracy.",
      "review.grammarly.try.free": "Try Free →",
      "review.grammarly.used.by.students.professionals.and": "Used by students, professionals, and businesses worldwide, Grammarly has evolved from a grammar checker into a comprehensive writing assistant. The platform's generative AI features can now help you compose, rewrite, and ideate, making it a complete solution for anyone who writes regularly. Whether you're crafting emails, writing reports, or creating content, Grammarly helps you communicate more effectively.",
      "review.grammarly.users": "Users",
      "review.grammarly.users.needing.offline.functionality.exclusively": "Users needing offline functionality exclusively",
      "review.grammarly.view.pricing": "View Pricing",
      "review.grammarly.what.makes.grammarly.exceptional.is": "What makes Grammarly exceptional is its seamless integration across virtually every writing platform you use. From web browsers and Microsoft Office to Gmail, Slack, and social media, Grammarly works wherever you write. Its AI-powered tone detection helps ensure your message lands the right way, while advanced features like plagiarism detection and brand consistency tools make it invaluable for professionals.",
      "review.grammarly.wordtune.focuses.more.on.rewriting": "Wordtune focuses more on rewriting and rephrasing suggestions, while Grammarly emphasizes correctness and clarity. Grammarly has better grammar checking and broader platform support. Wordtune offers more creative rewriting options but lacks plagiarism detection. Both tools complement each other well.",
      "review.grammarly.works.everywhere.you.write.online": "Works everywhere you write online - Gmail, social media, Google Docs, and more. Seamless integration across all platforms.",
      "review.grammarly.works.seamlessly.across.all.platforms": "Works seamlessly across all platforms"
