      "review.grammarly.grammarly.offers.superior.grammar.checking": "Grammarly offers superior grammar checking and broader platform integration, while QuillBot excels at paraphrasing and summarization. Grammarly's real-time suggestions are more comprehensive, but QuillBot provides better value for students needing paraphrasing tools. For general writing improvement, Grammarly is the better choice.",
