      "review.grammarly.faq1.answer": "Absolutely. The free version catches grammar, spelling, and punctuation errors effectively and works across all your writing platforms. While it lacks advanced features like tone detection and plagiarism checking, it's still one of the best free writing tools available and provides real value for casual users.",
      "review.grammarly.faq1.question": "Is Grammarly's free version worth using?",
