      "review.grammarly.faq5.answer": "Grammarly uses enterprise-grade security including 256-bit AES encryption and SOC 2 Type 2 certification. Your text is encrypted in transit and at rest. Grammarly doesn't sell your data or use it for advertising. Business and Enterprise plans offer additional security features like SAML SSO.",
